Message-ID: <CAB+QPJCMzUO_w0--F5ttn6JWvJdBysbpxFNZXZiPM_oP0WVz_A@mail.gmail.com>

I often find myself comparing nested lmer models like:

    m1 = lmer(
        dv ~ (1|R) + V1 + V2
    )
    m2 = lmer(
        dv ~ (1|R) + V1 + V2  + V1:V2
