From j.hadfield at ed.ac.uk  Thu Aug 25 18:17:03 2011
From: j.hadfield at ed.ac.uk (Jarrod Hadfield)
Date: Thu, 25 Aug 2011 17:17:03 +0100
Subject: [R-sig-ME] R: Re:  pMCMC and HPD in MCMCglmm
