Analysis of Variance Table

Response: happy
                        Df Sum Sq Mean Sq  F value    Pr(>F)
factor(obs)               1   2.30   2.303   2.4389    0.1216
factor(d)                 1 124.96 124.956 132.3367 < 2.2e-16
