	  * DESCRIPTION (Date, Version): 0.999375-34

	  * R/lmer.R (glmer_finalize): for a glmer(), allow q == n

	  * tests/lmer-1.R (rPoisGLMMi): test example, originating from Ben Bolker
  --------------------------------------------------------------

i.e. more than a year ago..

